upright("separated") & M_0 < 24028 \, med M_1 < 468015 & < 2.12 & < 7 dot.op 10^(- 14)\
upright("common kernel") & M = 10^6 & < 2.12 & < 4.1 dot.op 10^(- 13)\
upright("separate rounding") & M = 750000 & < 4.3 & < 5.23 dot.op 10^(- 13) $

